%%label II. Scherzo: Riffs
%%note D minor, 12/8 swing. A twelve-bar blues built from the quartet's motto: call and response over a plucked walking bass, a written-out solo chorus for the first violin, a chorus of traded solos, a hushed fugato on a riff subject, and the blues again.
X:1
T:Bernstein’s Missing Quartet
T:II. Scherzo: Riffs
C:Lor, in the manner of Leonard Bernstein
M:12/8
L:1/8
Q:"With a relaxed swing" 3/8=120
